<ul>
  <li><a href="https://studentaid.gov/articles/evaluating-financial-aid-offers/">Federal Student Aid: include commuting in college cost comparisons</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://www.transit.dot.gov/regulations-and-guidance/environmental-programs/public-transit-united-states">Federal Transit Administration: public transportation</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://www.nhtsa.gov/vehicle-safety-resources">National Highway Traffic Safety Administration: vehicle safety resources</a></li>
</ul>
<p><em>Last reviewed: August 16, 2026. Routes, discounts, parking, attendance, and accessibility services vary by campus and transportation provider.</em></p>
